# Eliminate the Impossible: "If any of them are suspected, they're no longer suspected." with two of them suspected
# Bot2's Case of the Stashed Skeleton makes a suspected Skeleton token and Bot1's J. Jonah Jameson suspects Bot2's Grizzly Bears. Eliminate the
# Impossible then shrinks both and both stop being suspected at once (CR 701.60, 608.2c), the -2/-0 and the unsuspecting as two sentences.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
J. Jonah Jameson
Eliminate the Impossible
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Grizzly Bears
Case of the Stashed Skeleton
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Case of the Stashed Skeleton.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Suspected = true
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.J. Jonah Jameson.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Suspected = true
Bot1.Hand.Eliminate the Impossible.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Suspected = (absent)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Suspected = (absent)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Skeleton Token.Power = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Clue Token.Token = True

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Eliminate the Impossible
